.TH "nvme_init_get_log_lockdown" 9 "nvme_init_get_log_lockdown" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_get_log_lockdown \- Initialize passthru command for Command and Feature Lockdown
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_get_log_lockdown
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u8 cnscp "  ","
.BI "__u16 cntlid "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_lockdown_log *lockdown_log "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "cnscp" 12
Contents and Scope of Command and Feature Identifier
Lists, see \fIenum nvme_lockdown_log_lsp\fP. Set the
NVME_LOCKDOWN_LOG_LSP_ELPF bit to request the
Controller-scoped Enhanced log page format instead of
the original format.
.IP "cntlid" 12
Controller Identifier: scopes the returned log page
to the specified controller if the ELPF bit is set in
\fIcnscp\fP. Ignored otherwise.
.IP "lockdown_log" 12
Buffer to store the lockdown log
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Get Log command with
LID value NVME_LOG_LID_CMD_AND_FEAT_LOCKDOWN
